<?xml version="1.0" ?>
<odoo>
    <!--
        Loan reference sequences.

        One sequence per company is provisioned in code (see
        ent_ohrms_loan.hooks.post_init for the installation and
        migrations/1.0.3/post-migrate.py for the upgrade): a reference series
        belongs to a single entity.

        The historical record that used to live here had no company_id, so
        Odoo bound it to the company active at installation time. Odoo's
        next_by_code only looks at company_id IN (current company, NULL):
        every other company found no sequence, and its loans were created
        with a blank name (' ') and unreadable accounting labels
        ("Loan   for <employee>"). Removing an XML record never deletes an
        existing row, so nothing already installed is lost.
    -->
</odoo>
